            "url": "https://javavolcano-touroperator.com/why-jvto/reviews/101",
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "waraporn arssanawitaya"
            },
            "datePublished": "2026-04-17",
            "reviewBody": "I’m truly impressed with this trip! Everything was beyond expectations.\n\nOur driver, Ahriela, was very polite, punctual, and took great care of us throughout the journey. He was also fun to talk to, which made the experience even more enjoyable.\n\nOur guide, Kiki, is an amazing photographer — every shot turned out beautifully! And the local guide at Tumpak Sewu waterfall was extremely professional, making us feel safe and well taken care of at all times.\n\nThis trip was full of happiness, fun, and unforgettable moments. Highly recommended!",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5",
              "bestRating": "5",
              "worstRating": "1"
            }
          },
